           2 |         2 |         2 |              2 |           2 |           2 |           2 |                2 |                  2 |           2 |            2 |     10 |     20 |     30 | 15.0000 |  25.000000 | f        | t        | {10,20,NULL} | {10,20,NULL}        | alpha,beta
